@startsalt wf-app-last-factor
' Low-fi wireframes — SCR-APP-LAST-FACTOR (bank mobile app), fed by RM-LAST-FACTOR-PROMPT.
' PROPOSAL, AI, 2026-09-19, iteration 3 (SRC-ADR 87c72b8: the app carries only the last factor).
' Whether the payment prompt repeats amount and payee is open (Q-46); trigger (push / QR / app link)
' is open (Q-45). Copy is placeholder.
title SCR-APP-LAST-FACTOR — bank app, low-fi wireframes (proposal)
{
  {+
    {* <b>Confirm it's you</b> }
    ..
    "You allowed <b>Sandbox AISP Ltd</b>"
    "to see 1 account until 1 Nov 2017"
    "on ⟨date, time⟩"
    ..
    "[ Face / fingerprint / PIN ]"
    ..
    { [ Not me — reject ] | [ Confirm ] }
  } | . | {+
    {* <b>Confirm it's you</b> }
    ..
    "Pay <b>123.50 EUR</b>"
    "to Merchant123"
    "DE02 1001 0010 9307 1186 03"
    "requested by Sandbox PISP Ltd (Q-46)"
    ..
    "[ Face / fingerprint / PIN ]"
    ..
    { [ Not me — reject ] | [ Confirm ] }
  }
}
@endsalt
